-- MT2009_PLUS_COLLECTOR_ITEM_V1: "Kolekcjoner" (70115, the ItemShop's, 1000 SM; never
-- used up). Its use opens the collector's storage ("Magazyn kolekcjonera") wherever
-- the character stands - before only at the storekeeper (Dozorca), from his safebox
-- window. "/kolekcjoner przedmiot" is the store's own command (playerbot_collector.cpp):
-- it checks the item is in the bag, the character alive, and keeps every other rule
-- of the storekeeper's store (moves with hands free, closes 15 m from where it
-- opened). The client opens the window on the store's first line, as at the
-- storekeeper. Bots never come here (they never buy it, and the command refuses them).
quest kolekcjoner_item begin
    state start begin
        when 70115.use begin
            command("kolekcjoner przedmiot")
        end
    end
end
